[{"title":"桐城青山裴山人枉步见寻兴尽遽归","author":"郭祥正","text":"门外青山是我山，手携筇杖只今还。\n岩花落尽莺啼懒，纸帐孤灯梦亦閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"史充侍禁以简问予小舟摇兀绝句戏谢","author":"郭祥正","text":"渡江乘兴泊江干，草衬残花色未乾。\n惯在钓鱼船上住，一蓑一笠伴春寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寺壁史侍禁画竹","author":"郭祥正","text":"不假研磨丹与青，只将墨妙夺天成。\n始知春力无虚实，老竹横穿栋柱生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西轩看山怀荆公","author":"郭祥正","text":"长忆金陵数往还，诵公佳句伴公閒。\n如今不复闻公语，独自西轩卧看山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨霁看小山","author":"郭祥正","text":"一番遇雨碧生烟，移得蓬瀛在枕前。\n范蠡更閒吾不爱，风波摇兀钓鱼船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辨山亭二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"叠径萦迂上小亭，云收天末数峰青。\n不嫌一鸟横空没，直恐纤埃点画屏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"辨山亭二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"小亭新得辨山名，云外峰峦画数层。\n太守引宾谋一醉，甘瓜不用集青蝇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永安再见裴材山人二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"青布为巾白布裘，逢人不拜肯低柔。\n一缸浊酒凝春绿，只与云山相献酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永安再见裴材山人二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"未到君家兴已阑，浮山十里望青山。\n梅花正似山阴雪，却棹孤舟夜半还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重题公纯池亭","author":"郭祥正","text":"凭栏尽日看山色，攲枕连宵听水声。\n一点红尘无入处，戴家池馆近清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮山阻雨二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"寻山一日遍浮山，却望江南兴欲还。\n半夜神龙兴骤雨，故留閒客伴僧閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浮山阻雨二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"云颙辞世几番春，老令霜髯未变尘。\n重拂旧题悲往事，幻身今幸作閒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48503,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雪呈守倅二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"出门骑马踏黄尘，归路随鞭布黑云。\n一夜猛风吹大雪，玉华千里压妖氛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48504,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜雪呈守倅二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"四面岚光似玉光，满城和气贺丰穰。\n红炉底事不邀客，回雪落梅空断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48505,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠啸月岩吴居士","author":"郭祥正","text":"幅巾藜杖客浮山，便隐深岩避世喧。\n每见月华何事啸，此身聊欲伴孤猿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48506,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"抚鸿亭","author":"郭祥正","text":"谁开岩户最高峰，更作栏干出半空。\n只道冥鸿远尘世，我今直下看冥鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西岩寺二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"西崖瀑布泻云中，移得匡庐一半工。\n要看玉潭千丈雪，莫教江月照还空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游西岩寺二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"三人同结静中缘，一到西岩思豁然。\n何必拥炉倾浊酒，且来攀树听寒泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中方寺题壁","author":"郭祥正","text":"西岩晓起过中方，欲趁春归客思忙。\n不似野僧忘岁月，手披黄卷满头霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题潘温叟家藏戴牛画卷二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"不辞耕遍主家田，日暮归时欲饱眠。\n渡尽惊波莫回首，后来犹苦牧儿鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题潘温叟家藏戴牛画卷二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"茫茫陂水暮秋天，乍晚耕犁未得眠。\n矫首冲波方尽力，牧儿何用更挥鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"招陈守倪倅小酌","author":"郭祥正","text":"梅花落尽杏花迟，终日廉纤细雨霏。\n不倒一樽消客恨，可令醒眼送春归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书无想山先域屋壁二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"东岭杉松手自栽，已成浓荫覆泉台。\n满头白发行催死，能得生前几度来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书无想山先域屋壁二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"寒食年年一度来，伤心扪涕陟崔嵬。\n溪云欲雨还催去，更绕营丘百匝回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出城","author":"郭祥正","text":"篮舆投晓出重城，桃李无言似有情。\n淡白轻红能几日，可怜吹洗过清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"敦复午节惠酒","author":"郭祥正","text":"双壶分送赤泥封，辟恶须令气吐虹。\n何用江心铸明镜，清樽照面似青铜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵杨侯见送游五峰","author":"郭祥正","text":"飘然忽作五峰游，三伏谁知冷似秋。\n为在深云更深处，手提白羽看泉流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟经天门山","author":"郭祥正","text":"轻舟幸借东风便，帆挂危樯掣惊电。\n万群白马度天门，谁道澄江静如练。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿芜湖口","author":"郭祥正","text":"菱荇芬香莲子熟，扁舟夜趁湖阴宿。\n一杯独酌未成歌，渔人解唱遗鞭曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓发","author":"郭祥正","text":"欲就沧浪濯烦热，解缆莫愁潮信歇。\n阴云映日一帆风，信道长江无六月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代刺访历阳孙守公素","author":"郭祥正","text":"月洗晴江秋愈清，扁舟西渡历阳城。\n渔翁贽见无羔雁，满袖盈襟皆月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代刺别孙守公素","author":"郭祥正","text":"遏云歌阕酒樽空，离别情怀自古同。\n卷取西城吟袖月，却飞兰棹过江东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送菊与刘守汉臣","author":"郭祥正","text":"一年爱惜傍东篱，今日才开四五枝。\n折与刘郎休叹老，嫩黄新白恰相宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送菊与倪倅敦复","author":"郭祥正","text":"重阳相近雁初飞，谁剪黄金撒翠微。\n莫学龙山空落帽，杜郎须插满头归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"望夫石","author":"郭祥正","text":"帆去帆来人不识，岁岁年年望无极。\n夕阳欲尽洲渚昏，犹见天门一双碧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢贾侍御惠酒","author":"郭祥正","text":"赤壶分送陵阳酒，黄菊犹开雨后花。\n一醉不知身世晚，却临河汉欲乘槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再送贾明叔侍御","author":"郭祥正","text":"宣城重见谢玄晖，只恐斯民不久依。\n为报圣朝容谏诤，南床虚位待公归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗公香瑩轩二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"酴醾洞口作新轩，香瑩佳名自此传。\n要是酿为光禄酒，醉来骑鹤上青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宗公香瑩轩二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"素质曾将兰麝熏，开轩有意待游人。\n请看一架晴空雪，又胜桃源洞里春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐希皋解元送白莲栽兼寄昭掾子美三首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"吾家新叠小蓬莱，三尺青天一沼开。\n更得城南白莲种，花时留待月光来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐希皋解元送白莲栽兼寄昭掾子美三首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"城南移得玉华栽，栽向方池两岁开。\n有酒有花无伴侣，良朋何日远方来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵徐希皋解元送白莲栽兼寄昭掾子美三首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"玉莲移得手亲栽，要看中秋月下开。\n安得君归相伴饮，君家子弟亦尝来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"藏云寺酌泉","author":"郭祥正","text":"不到藏云四十年，寺名重换屋新迁。\n清泠不变当时味，只有庭心一眼泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵池守富仲容寄诗酒为别二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"投老应须结主知，翱翔郎省已多时。\n南风一送轻舟去，更与何人细论诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵池守富仲容寄诗酒为别二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"万事无心只自知，一庵高卧乐明时。\n池州太守能怜客，美酒分来更赠诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48536,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奠谒王荆公坟三首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"再拜孤坟奠浊醪，春风斜日漫蓬蒿。\n扶持自出轲雄上，光焰宁论万丈高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48537,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奠谒王荆公坟三首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"大手曾将元鼎调，龙沉鹤去事寥寥。\n寺楼早晚传钟响，坟草春回雪半消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48538,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奠谒王荆公坟三首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"平昔偏蒙爱小诗，如今吟就复谁知。\n箧中不忍开遗卷，矫矫龙蛇彼一时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48539,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"狄倅伯通席上二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"梅山曾共听蛮鼙，又看汀洲白鹭飞。\n一榼琼浆要我醉，不忘交旧似君稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"狄倅伯通席上二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"小妓三娇舞玳筵，芙蓉照水一枝鲜。\n层冰赤脚真吾事，笑倚春风愧暮年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿宁禅院琼花","author":"郭祥正","text":"一种琼花内相栽，隔年琲?待春开。\n谁知暖日留繁雪，更有清香引蝶来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊明惠师","author":"郭祥正","text":"平云寄隐尽成灰，三十年间一梦回。\n言说已无形影在，屋梁残月送馀哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别贾侍御二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"君正忙时我正闲，思君乘兴出青山。\n倚楼怀抱都倾尽，却驾柴车破雨还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别贾侍御二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"连日持杯选胜游，今朝兴尽棹归舟。\n欲知魂梦思君处，却御清风过北楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48545,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄留二君仪","author":"郭祥正","text":"今岁看书眼觉昏，忆君待酒只销魂。\n临漳姑孰五千里，怀抱何时得再论。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48546,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄新轩阮希圣","author":"郭祥正","text":"遥想新轩日日新，清风细细起青蘋。\n后来诗客谁如我，定有新交胜故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48547,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予家小山四首 其一 晓","author":"郭祥正","text":"晓光初透玉玲珑，迥与真山意思同。\n苍翠正含烟雾湿，一峰先占太阳红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48548,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予家小山四首 其二 雨","author":"郭祥正","text":"林林银竹注潺湲，迸玉跳珠乱壑间。\n不惜倚栏襟袖湿，为君吟出雨中山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48549,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予家小山四首 其三 月","author":"郭祥正","text":"小山凝望月明间，天与金银作小山。\n愿得月轮长不去，一山光景付吾閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48550,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"予家小山四首 其四 雪","author":"郭祥正","text":"皎皎群峰照画栏，深深岩窦逼人寒。\n雪中更看玲珑雪，纵有丹青貌亦难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48551,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西轩默怀敦复二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"小盆小石小芭蕉，水面纹生暑气消。\n明眼客来时一眄，已知吾意在鹪鹩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48552,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西轩默怀敦复二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"山下无尘枕簟凉，绿池水满即潇湘。\n青蕉况有菖蒲伴，閒淡风标细细香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48553,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出城至龙泉院","author":"郭祥正","text":"出城霜霰侵衣冷，入寺云山掠眼明。\n幸有青钱沽白酒，得閒行处即閒行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48554,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"院主老僧年八十三斋洁可喜遂赠二韵","author":"郭祥正","text":"八十馀三老阿师，云山深僻少人知。\n不嫌野鹤水为伴，庭下閒松借一枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48555,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城西阻雨寄纯父太守","author":"郭祥正","text":"三春复作历阳游，倾听高谈洗我忧。\n已出重城望宾榻，暗天风雨泊孤舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48556,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"浚遒卧病少愈言怀","author":"郭祥正","text":"入竹细风连阵暖，隔墙幽鸟数声和。\n病馀斗惜春归速，枝上残红应不多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48557,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉蝶球","author":"郭祥正","text":"玉蝶交加翅羽柔，八仙琼萼并含羞。\n春残应恨无花采，翠碧枝间戏作球。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48558,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀归","author":"郭祥正","text":"黄鹂出谷鸣声软，紫燕营巢意思和。\n欲问江南近消息，落花飞絮向人多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48559,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡","author":"郭祥正","text":"窗户无风天气阴，屏山围枕鬓云深。\n秋波不动芙蓉暖，化蝶惊飞君莫寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48560,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"笑","author":"郭祥正","text":"檀口微开皓齿香，眼波浮动脸生光。\n桃花未落燕脂浅，半飐春风半倚墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48561,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元舆待制以书酒见招","author":"郭祥正","text":"驿骑东行得素书，便趋宾榻驾柴车。\n赋诗我未如陶令，养浩君能似子舆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48562,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奕","author":"郭祥正","text":"一枰相对漫怡神，白黑争先局局新。\n不觉斧柯从此烂，甘心谁是肯输人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48563,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和北山泉老三首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"从来心照两相通，信饷瓶盛自在空。\n谁道钟山远姑熟，北窗时复揖清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48564,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和北山泉老三首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"蓼花红淡苇条黄，故有离人思抑扬。\n手眼不知相拗否，墨华时寄两三行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48565,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和北山泉老三首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"已将形影老江南，不饮情怀稍自谙。\n安得道人挥玉麈，一宵清语响圜庵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48566,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和僧诜见怀二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"城角蓬茅三亩居，空堂唯有一床书。\n感师相遇怜清淡，若比陶潜尚不如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48567,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和僧诜见怀二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"眉目棱棱有古风，却疑曾作钓鱼翁。\n一竿明月空抛掷，谁道烟波无处穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48568,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访华阳隐者","author":"郭祥正","text":"小径斜分石磴通，萧萧古屋隔杉松。\n主人无事昼慵起，残雪满庭春未融。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":48569,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]